Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 13:03:36 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 004/371] pirates: crews (Sept 2026 family-server fixes)

- DistributedPirateBandManagerAI: implement the crew (band) server side that
  POC never wrote, so an invite no longer hangs on "Seeing if X is available"
  (invite, accept, leave, roster, ship info for crewmates).
- DistributedBandMemberAI: one real member object per crew member, generated
  in the management zone so every client's crew HUD lists the roster
  (was an __init__-only stub).
- DistributedPlayerPirateAI: leave the crew on logout.
- DistributedDinghyAI: offer a crewmate's deployed ship at the dinghy and
  handle selectBandShip; refuse a ship that is still activating (it killed
  the district); launch your own ship at the berth in front of the dinghy.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
